## The structure of this repository

`electron_scattering.py` - core routine that handles that scattering kinematics and ...

`spectrum.dat` - example source spectrum for scattering processing.

`correctness_tests.ipynb` - tests...

`Laor_comparison.ipynb` - comparison of a similar computation published in Laor et al. (2006)
